<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Lies, Revenge and Locked away Memories</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Scarlet has now been a couple weeks in the Horde, locked up in the Black Garnet room and left to stew on her agonizing thoughts of how she got here. But not today, today Shadow Weaver has decided to let her stay with the others for the first time, so maybe she won't be alone anymore.... She thinks as a prickly Cat girl and an energetic smiling Blond meet her again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then we jump to some years in the future to their time as teens, trying to figure themselves out and their life in this harsh place. Catra slowly having to accept that maybe having one more person to trust wouldn't be so bad in her pre teens while Adora happily takes on more responsibility according to Weaver.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We follow the trio as they handle normal Horde troubles while their step mother keeps a very close eye on her golden child.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This goes more into what Catra's, Adora's and Scarlets childhood would've been like. Since I didn't feel like I completely got that conveyed through the little time they were all together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;NOTICE: This is a prequal to Fang's, Claw's and a girl with a Sword. And I recommend reading chapters 1 and 2 of it before reading this, but if you want to go in blind you can since you'll only miss some context.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Scarlet_Ice</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
